sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant Web as SvelteKit(웹)
    participant Page as +page.server.ts
    participant Apple as Apple OAuth
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant CB as /auth/callback
    participant Hooks as hooks.server.ts

    note over User,CB: ①~⑩ 로그인하고 홈으로 이동
    User->>Web: ① Apple로 로그인 클릭
    Web->>Page: form POST (use:enhance)
    Page->>Auth: ② signInWithOAuth({provider:'apple'})
    Auth-->>Page: Apple 로그인 URL 반환
    Page-->>User: ③ Apple 서버로 redirect(302)
    User->>Apple: ④ Apple 계정으로 인증 완료
    Apple-->>User: ⑤ /auth/callback?code=... 로 redirect
    User->>CB: ⑥ code 전달
    CB->>Auth: ⑦ exchangeCodeForSession(code)
    Auth-->>CB: ⑧ JWT(access_token) 반환
    note over CB: ⑨ httpOnly 쿠키에 JWT 저장\n(locals.supabase SSR 자동처리)
    CB-->>User: ⑩ 홈으로 redirect(303, '/')

    note over User,Hooks: ⑪~⑮ 페이지 요청마다
    User->>Web: ⑪ 페이지 요청 (쿠키 자동 첨부)
    Web->>Hooks: ⑫ safeGetSession() 호출
    Hooks->>Auth: ⑬ getUser() — 서버에서 토큰 재검증
    Auth-->>Hooks: ⑭ 유효한 user 반환
    note over Hooks: ⑮ session + user → event.locals 저장
